gsc_opportunities.summary:
Free GSC declining pages, low-CTR queries and striking-distance candidates.

Use an enabled property. days<=90, row_limit<=500. Evidence uses returned GSC rows;
missing rows are unknown and average position is not a fixed ranking.

get_search_analytics.summary:
Search performance for a property. Dimensions are comma-separated.

Defaults to exactly 28 inclusive days. Free supports 30 days and 100 rows;
paid plans support 16 months and up to 25,000 rows.
